    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lo̱k Kuɔth kɛ thiec Dhid-ki-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛmɛ ɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial mëë ci ben kä Yir-mɛ-yaa mëë ca jɛ jäk kä Pɛ̈c-ɣur gat Mal-ki-yaa kɛnɛ bo̱o̱th palä ni Dhɛ-pɛ̈n-yaa gat Mä-the-yaa ɛ kuäär ni Dhid-ki-yaa wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Thiec ni nɛy Kuoth Nhial, kɛ ɣöö go̱o̱r Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cɔalkɛ jɛ kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ gua̱thni kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru i̱ Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar, kuɛnɛ kä Yir-mɛ-yaa 21:2, kɛ thok loŋɛlithni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ko̱r kɛ kɔ. Dɔ̱ŋ bi Kuoth Nhial lätkɛ tin ga̱ykɛ naath la̱t, a bɛ jɛ jak kä locɛ jɔk kä kɔ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yir-mɛ-yaa kɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bia nɛmɛ wä la̱r Dhid-ki-yaa i̱, ‘Ci Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl ruac ɛn ɣöö ɣän bä yio̱w köörun tɔ̱ te tetnikun tɔ̱, tin bia wä tɛr ni ko̱r kɛ kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛnɛ ji̱ Kɛ̈l-da-ya tɔ̱ ca yɛ go̱l tɔ̱ jɔk pa̱a̱ny luɔ̱c yɛ. Ɣän bä kɛ nööŋ kɛɛl ɛn däär wec ɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän bä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ kɛ buɔ̱mdä kɛɛliw, gakdä kɛnɛ ŋɛ̈ɛ̈nydä min di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bä kɛn ji̱ wec ɛmɛ näk, naath kɛ ley bikɛ li̱w kɛ juey mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔrɛ, ɣän bä Dhid-ki-yaa kɛnɛ la̱a̱tkɛ kɛ nɛy tin cieŋ ɛn wi̱c ɛmɛ tin ci kään kä juey kɛnɛ ko̱r kɛ buɔth, la̱th tetdä Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛnɛ tet ji̱ tɛ̈riɛn kɛ nɛy tin görkɛ näkdiɛn. Ɛ ba kɛ näk nikɛ mut, a thil pälikä kiɛ jiath lɔaac.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi nɛy ti̱ti̱ jiök i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial nɛmɛ lar i̱, ‘Ɣän cä duɔ̱ɔ̱p teekä kɛnɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p li̱eth la̱th nhiamdun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram ɔ bi tey ɛn wi̱c ɛmɛ ɔ, ba jɛ näk ɛ ko̱r kɛnɛ buɔth kɛ juey. Kä ram mi wä rɔ thöp ji̱ Kɛ̈l-da-ya ti ca yɛ go̱l ti, bɛ tëk ɛn ram ɛmɔ, bɛ tëkdɛ lëny raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä nhiamdä luɔ̱c ɛn wec ɛmɛ kɛ jiääk a /ci mɔ a gɔy. Ba jɛ la̱th tetdä kua̱r Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, kä bɛ jɛ waŋ kɛ mac, ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac kɛ kui̱ kua̱ri Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jio̱kni ji̱ dhɔaar kua̱r Juda i̱, “Liɛŋɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lö dhɔr Dee-bid! Ci Kuoth Nhial wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
